LeetCode 1225: Report Contiguous Dates

The Problem Statement
You are given two tables: Failed (dates when tasks failed) and Succeeded (dates when tasks succeeded).
The goal is to write a query that identifies every continuous period of consecutive days where tasks shared the exact same state.
The report must only include dates in the year 2019 (2019-01-01 to 2019-12-31). 
For each continuous block, you must output the state (succeeded or failed), the start date of that block, and the end date, ordered by the start date.

Expected_output:
period_state,start_date,end_date
succeeded,2019-01-01,2019-01-03
failed,2019-01-04,2019-01-05
succeeded,2019-01-06,2019-01-06
